body: |2-
  Your mission of 18:25 UTC ('2ad53b5b'). All four things are done, in
  'tools/team/': 'spending_account.py', its test, 'specialist.sh' and
  'pacer.sh'. The script has run over every transcript there is (146
  rows, 4297 requests; no transcript was yet deleted, so every row's new
  columns are filled but 'mission_kind', which no older prompt carries).
  'bash/all-tests.sh' passed whole, the team tool tests included; the
  failure you warned of in Jeff's code did not appear.
